    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T5">Moringa</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T15">: Nature’s Superfood</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Moringa</text:span>: All the good stuff </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P3">with no side effects.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Moringa</text:span>: More nutritional power than kale, spinish, Swiss Chard, and broccoli.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P21"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Moringa: </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13">Clean Energy</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4"><text:span text:style-name="T2">Moringa</text:span>: The most vitamin dense </text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P4">plant on Earth</text:p>
