     </draw:image>
    </draw:frame><text:span text:style-name="T19">Moringa</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13">is often called a ‘</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T23">M</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">iracle </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T23">T</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T18">ree</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13">’ because it is considered effective in combating global warming due to its growth and ability to absorb carbon dioxide </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T14">at 50 times faster than cedar trees</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T13">. </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T19">Moringa</text:span> can be consumed in many forms including:</text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L1">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P23">Powder </text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P23">Extra-Fine Powder</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P23">Raw Leaves</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P23">Dried Leaves</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P23">Course Shredded Dried Leaves</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P23">Oil</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P23">Seeds</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P23">Tea Leaves</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P24"><text:span text:style-name="T10">Stems</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P25"><text:span text:style-name="T10"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P46"><text:span text:style-name="T25">M</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T26">oringa</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T30"> is exceptionally nutritious:</text:span></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L3">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:list>
      <text:list-item>
       <text:p text:style-name="P32">92 nutrients including </text:p>
       <text:list>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P32">vitamins</text:p>
        </text:list-item>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P32">minerals</text:p>
        </text:list-item>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P32">amino acids</text:p>
        </text:list-item>
       </text:list>
      </text:list-item>
      <text:list-item>
       <text:p text:style-name="P32">46 antioxidants</text:p>
       <text:list>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P32">High protein content</text:p>
         <text:list>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P32">all essential amino acids</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
         </text:list>
        </text:list-item>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P32">Rich in vitamins: </text:p>
         <text:list>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P32">A, C, E, and B-complex</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
         </text:list>
        </text:list-item>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P32">Mineral-rich: </text:p>
         <text:list>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P32"><text:span text:style-name="T12">C</text:span>alcium</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P32"><text:span text:style-name="T12">I</text:span>ron</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P32"><text:span text:style-name="T12">M</text:span>agnesium</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P32"><text:span text:style-name="T12">Z</text:span>inc</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P32"><text:span text:style-name="T12">Po</text:span>tassium</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
         </text:list>
        </text:list-item>
        <text:list-item>
         <text:p text:style-name="P32">Anti-inflammatory compounds:</text:p>
         <text:list>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P32">Isothiocyanates</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
          <text:list-item>
           <text:p text:style-name="P32"><text:span text:style-name="T12">F</text:span>lavonoids</text:p>
          </text:list-item>
         </text:list>
        </text:list-item>
       </text:list>
      </text:list-item>
     </text:list>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P42"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19">According to Dr. Bill Messer, <text:span text:style-name="T19">Moringa</text:span> is the most vitamin dense pla<text:span text:style-name="T1">n</text:span>t on Earth. Among its benefits:</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Used to feed starving children in Africa.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Protects and nourishes skin and hair.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Treats Edema.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Protects the Liver.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Prevents and Treats Cancer.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Treats Intestinal Discomfort.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Fights Bacterial Diseases.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Improves Bone Health.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Treats Mood Disoders.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Protects the Cardiovascular System.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Treats Diabetes by Lowering Blood Sugar Levels.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Improves Asthma Symptoms.</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:span text:style-name="T17"><text:s text:c="4"/>• Gives Energy—</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T21">don’t take </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T22">before bed</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P19"><text:span text:style-name="T10"/></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P30"><text:span text:style-name="T17">Other benefits attributed to </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T20">Moringa</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T17"> consuption:</text:span></text:p>
   <text:list text:style-name="L4">
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P31">anti-diabetic</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P31">anti-cancer</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P31">anti-ulcer</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P31">anti-microbial</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P31">anti-oxidan<text:span text:style-name="T27">t</text:span></text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P31"><text:soft-page-break/><text:span text:style-name="T27">c</text:span>urbing malnutrition</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
    <text:list-item>
     <text:p text:style-name="P35">energises elderly</text:p>
    </text:list-item>
   </text:list>
   <text:p text:style-name="P29"><text:span text:style-name="T28">People are more aware about health-related issues than ever before and they are very much interested in taking healthy, nutritious food. Food which has a wide range of health benefits may prevent or cure various chronic diseases are also desired. This kind of extraordinary food is also termed as super food. Scient</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29">ists</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T28"> worldwide have <text:s/>identified </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T24">Moringa</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T28"> </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T29">a</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T28"> source of healthy and nutritious food properties.</text:span></text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P33"/>
   <text:p text:style-name="P43">Our Farm</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="P34"><text:s text:c="4"/>• <text:span text:style-name="T35">??</text:span> hectare (?? acre) farm in Indonesia.</text:p>
